    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials of Valor is a  roguelike fighting game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic RPGs, it blends simple class-based characters with fast, skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path across a boardgame-style map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your starting class and build your own unique playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your attacks, abilities  dodges and blocks to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/0e2049364ecaa68db4f672ef154eea32.webp?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=34 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/94683d227650d82df4a25e3cee677f6b.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=198 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, block and attack in real time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect timing can be the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.poster.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.webm?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.mp4?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/bd53cc31c3d980c1994a960e4a391fd6.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=198 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different with randomized map content, gear modifiers and encounters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the optimal abilities, equipment and charms to help you defeat your enemies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right time to use your primary and secondary weapon. <br>Each weapon comes with its own unique set of abilities you can use to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.poster.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.webm?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.mp4?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ selectable abilities\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ positive/negative gear modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ charms to increase your chance of victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ character stats that are easy to understand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to receive a notification when this exciting adventure releases!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials of Valor is a  roguelike fighting game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic RPGs, it blends simple class-based characters with fast, skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path across a boardgame-style map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your starting class and build your own unique playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your attacks, abilities  dodges and blocks to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/0e2049364ecaa68db4f672ef154eea32.webp?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=34 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/94683d227650d82df4a25e3cee677f6b.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=198 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, block and attack in real time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect timing can be the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.poster.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.webm?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.mp4?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/bd53cc31c3d980c1994a960e4a391fd6.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=198 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different with randomized map content, gear modifiers and encounters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the optimal abilities, equipment and charms to help you defeat your enemies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right time to use your primary and secondary weapon. <br>Each weapon comes with its own unique set of abilities you can use to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.poster.avif?t=1755413527\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.webm?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.mp4?t=1755413527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ selectable abilities\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ positive/negative gear modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ charms to increase your chance of victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ character stats that are easy to understand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to receive a notification when this exciting adventure releases!</strong></p>",
